          "Fingerprint": "sha256:e76ae7f186fbf1b1b01d74ea5a9cf72b4a63cdef0b6d5a579a8ad0dfd2d701fa",
          "Title": "org.springframework/spring-webmvc: Spring Framework: Remote Code Execution via improper path limitation in XsltView",
